# The one-call promise and its limit. A submit waits up to 8 s for the decision (under Android OkHttp's
# 10 s default read timeout). A provider that answers inside the wait gives a final status in the same call;
# one that doesn't gives the current status, and GET returns the rest later.

@onboarding = http://localhost:5100
@simulators = http://localhost:5300
@image = /9j/4EFUTEFTIFRFU1QgSU1BR0X/2Q==

### 1. IDNow at 4 s instead of 2 s: the whole chain still fits (about 4 + 1 + 0.4 s). Expect 201 APPROVED.
PUT {{simulators}}/_control/idnow
Content-Type: application/json

{ "mode": "healthy", "latencyMs": 4000 }

###
POST {{onboarding}}/v1/markets/MB/applications
Content-Type: application/json
Idempotency-Key: {{$guid}}

{
  "firstName": "Test",
  "lastName": "Tester",
  "dateOfBirth": "1990-01-01",
  "nationality": "XB",
  "countryOfResidence": "XB",
  "identifier": { "type": "NATIONAL_ID", "value": "9876543210987", "issuingCountry": "XB" },
  "email": "applicant@example.test",
  "phone": "+15550100100",
  "documents": [
    { "type": "PASSPORT", "image": "{{image}}" },
    { "type": "SELFIE", "image": "{{image}}" }
  ],
  "termsAccepted": true
}

### 2. IDNow at 9 s: past the wait. Expect 201 IN_PROGRESS with nextAction WAIT after about 8 s ...
PUT {{simulators}}/_control/idnow
Content-Type: application/json

{ "mode": "slow" }

###
# @name slow
POST {{onboarding}}/v1/markets/MB/applications
Content-Type: application/json
Idempotency-Key: {{$guid}}

{
  "firstName": "Test",
  "lastName": "Tester",
  "dateOfBirth": "1990-01-01",
  "nationality": "XB",
  "countryOfResidence": "XB",
  "identifier": { "type": "NATIONAL_ID", "value": "9876543210987", "issuingCountry": "XB" },
  "email": "applicant@example.test",
  "phone": "+15550100100",
  "documents": [
    { "type": "PASSPORT", "image": "{{image}}" },
    { "type": "SELFIE", "image": "{{image}}" }
  ],
  "termsAccepted": true
}

### ... and APPROVED a few seconds later.
GET {{onboarding}}/v1/markets/MB/applications/{{slow.response.body.applicationId}}
X-Application-Token: {{slow.response.body.applicationToken}}

### Back to normal.
PUT {{simulators}}/_control/idnow
Content-Type: application/json

{ "mode": "healthy" }
